# Read by BuildKit for infra/prod/Dockerfile (the context is the repository root). The Dockerfile copies named
# paths only; this list keeps everything else, and anything secret, out of the build context.
.git
**/.git
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.superpowers
.claude
docs
**/test
**/e2e
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
